
# File: 010-traceroute-icmp-reply-in-req-accept.rule
# Title: Allow remote NTP client request to local NTP server

# Inbound ICMP Time Exceeded response to outbound traceroute
icmp type time-exceeded counter accept comment "remote-to-local outbound traceroute ICMP exceeded response"

# Inbound ICMP Destination Unreachable response to outbound traceroute
icmp type destination-unreachable counter accept comment "remote-to-local outbound traceroute ICMP unreachable"
